# Generated from `forge build`, never committed. Both are packaged into their
# published artefact (the crate embeds artifacts/ via include_dir!, the npm
# package ships src/abis), so CI regenerates them before every build, test,
# dry-run and publish. Locally:
#   scripts/vendor-artifacts.sh     # -> rust/contracts/artifacts
#   pnpm -C ts codegen              # -> ts/packages/contracts/src/abis
rust/contracts/artifacts/
ts/packages/contracts/src/abis/
ts/packages/contracts/src/calls/
